Maintenance and PHP Versions
****************************

.[perex]
Nette is a framework with an exceptionally long support period for individual releases. Each series is an LTS (Long-Term Support Release) with support for at least 2 years.

The newest series of each package is actively maintained, older series receive security fixes for at least two years from their initial stable release.

.[supported-series]
| Package | Active series | Released | PHP | Security fixes only
|---------
| [Application |https://github.com/nette/application] | 3.3 | 6/2026 | 8.3 - 8.6 | 3.2
| [Assets |https://github.com/nette/assets] | 1.0 | 5/2025 | 8.1 - 8.6 |
| [Bootstrap |https://github.com/nette/bootstrap] | 3.3 | 6/2026 | 8.3 - 8.6 |
